(7606884, 1230399, 124815, '<td valign="top">Topic is important but a picture just meeting it has no value in my opinion.<br/>I always say to myself: why would I look at this more?<br/>Not in your case though. The geometry and play of shadows, plus the texture makes this an interesting picture to look at.As it is, it has a story to tell<br/> <br/>(and you get an extra point for not including the words simple, short or sweet in the title)</td>', 'Topic is important but a picture just meeting it has no value in my opinion.I always say to myself: why would I look at this more?Not in your case though. The geometry and play of shadows, plus the texture makes this an interesting picture to look at.As it is, it has a story to tell (and you get an extra point for not including the words simple, short or sweet in the title)', '2019-01-04 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
